  "mechanics": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "value": [
      {
        "name": "Time Switch",
        "text": "Shift between Present and Past. Platforms appear, walls vanish and hazards change."
      },
      {
        "name": "Time Beam",
        "text": "Freeze objects across both timelines; bounce beams off mirrors to hit targets around corners."
      },
      {
        "name": "Box Pull",
        "text": "Grab and move boxes into position to solve environmental puzzles."
      },
      {
        "name": "Dash and Double Jump",
        "text": "Movement abilities that open paths that were visible but previously unreachable."
      }
    ]
  },
  "structure": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "value": "Progression is gated by abilities, not combat: each new tool opens paths that were visible but previously unreachable. The hotel is interconnected, with hidden rooms and shortcuts."
  },
  "contributions": {
    "status": "confirmed",
    "value": [
      "The era system — collision layers, object state and physics swapping in step, with a crush check so time closing around the player is a death rather than a glitch.",
      "Procedural puzzle generators with Scene-view grid painting: pipe networks with a connectivity solver, and elemental puzzles that pick their own elements by counting how many valid solutions each set allows.",
      "A save system built around an objective ledger, so a reloaded world remembers which doors are open and which puzzles are done.",
      "An in-build debug console for playtesters — noclip, ability grants, scene jumps and objective control without an editor."
    ]
  },
